One addition since the 16:40Z count. 83d0941535 added "deterministic CPU
independent reduction" alongside its own results/ artifact, verified with
git show --name-only. Still self-served without exception: 24 of 24.

The rate slowed -- 2 additions in six hours to 16:40Z, 1 in the nine hours since --
but that is three intervals on a small sample and the entry says so rather than
calling it a trend.

More useful is the second counter-example. exp6862 declared "deterministic CPU
dual-side exact checking", drew the SUBSTRATE_HAS_NO_DURATION_FLOOR warn, and did
not add its string, exactly as exp6849 did yesterday. Two tasks have now taken the
